# End-to-End-Book-Recommender-System

# How to run?
### STEPS:

### STEP 01 - Create a conda environment after opening the respositry

```bash
conda create -n book python=3.7.10 -y
```

```bash
conda activate book
```
### STEP 02 - install the requirements
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt 
```
